ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Hall County shows 75 years of record since 1951. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. On the middle of the grids, 2025 ran 43% of normal in November to December, and 2026 so far sits at 40% in March to April. A preliminary estimate for grid 16984 puts August to September 2026 at 77.3.</p>"}
